WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.071
Here's how to get Trade Levels Pro's levels

00:00:02.071 --> 00:00:04.363
drawn right on your TradingView chart.

00:00:04.363 --> 00:00:05.403
Takes about a minute.

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:09.032
Open Today's Plan on tradelevelspro.com.

00:00:09.032 --> 00:00:10.869
Make sure you're logged in as a member.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:14.083
Click Show TradingView indicator code.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.316
Hit Copy code.

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:17.505
It flips to Copied.

00:00:17.705 --> 00:00:20.290
Now open TradingView and pull up ES,

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:22.572
the E-mini S&P futures.

00:00:22.772 --> 00:00:24.064
Open the Pine Editor.

00:00:25.522 --> 00:00:26.646
Select everything,

00:00:26.646 --> 00:00:27.981
and paste in the code.

00:00:28.422 --> 00:00:29.566
Click Add to chart.

00:00:31.972 --> 00:00:32.923
And there it is.

00:00:33.622 --> 00:00:35.582
Today's long levels, targets,

00:00:35.582 --> 00:00:37.292
shorts and invalidation,

00:00:37.292 --> 00:00:38.683
drawn right on your chart,

00:00:38.683 --> 00:00:40.419
with the bias in the corner.

00:00:40.719 --> 00:00:42.701
Open settings to choose what you see,

00:00:42.701 --> 00:00:46.200
like targets, backup longs or rejection shorts.

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:48.627
Every day, when the new plan comes out,

00:00:48.627 --> 00:00:49.947
do the same thing.

00:00:49.947 --> 00:00:52.017
Copy the fresh code from Today's Plan,

00:00:52.017 --> 00:00:54.304
paste it over the old code in Pine Editor,

00:00:54.304 --> 00:00:55.912
and click Update on chart.

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:58.849
TradingView can't pull it in on its own,

00:00:58.849 --> 00:01:01.144
so it's a quick re-copy each day.

00:01:01.444 --> 00:01:02.731
Full plan available.

00:01:02.731 --> 00:01:03.553
Get a free sample at

00:01:03.553 --> 00:01:06.653
tradelevelspro.com/sample
